  "description": "Older USB keyboards (Yamaha Motif and the like, which say they are vendor specific) work on the OP-Z's USB host, and SHIFT + PROJECT switches between HOST and INSTRUMENT (only receives MIDI). See usbhost/usbhost.c.",
